<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Life, Life, O the issue is Life.</l><l>Living isn’t worth it if you haven’t got Life.</l><l>So drop all your concepts, they’re killing you dead,</l><l>And touch the living Jesus instead.</l><l>And touch the living Jesus instead.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>God, God, O you gave us your Son,</l><l>He died for us and rose again; the victory He won!</l><l>And now He lives within us, new life has begun.</l><l>O we praise You, Lord, it all has been done.</l><l>O we praise You, Lord, it all has been done.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
